{
  "name": "Send Stripe PDF Invoices and Recover Failed Payments on WhatsApp with Google Sheets, Slack, and Supergreen",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "b7070007-7777-4777-8777-000000000001",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 1180,
        "content": "## Closed-Loop Stripe PDF Receipts & Failed-Payment Dunning Engine on WhatsApp\n\n### Who this is for\nSaaS teams, subscription businesses, and agencies on Stripe losing MRR to unread dunning emails who want instant WhatsApp PDF receipts on paid renewals plus interactive, self-serve payment recovery polls when cards fail.\n\n### Architecture (4 Coordinated Flows)\n1. **Flow 1 - Real-Time Stripe Invoice Router (Paid PDF vs. Failed Dunning):**\n   - **Stripe Trigger** listens for `invoice.payment_succeeded` and `invoice.payment_failed`, deduplicates retries via **Remove Duplicates**, and fetches the full **Stripe Customer** record so phone numbers stored on either the customer or `metadata.whatsapp_phone` are resolved reliably.\n   - **Paid path:** Downloads the official Stripe `invoice_pdf` binary, delivers the named PDF receipt over WhatsApp via **Supergreen**, and upserts `Paid` in the **Google Sheets** `Invoices` ledger.\n   - **Failed path:** Creates a live **Stripe Billing Portal Session** (`POST /v1/billing_portal/sessions`) for 1-click card updates, sends the portal link on WhatsApp, follows up with a 3-option **WhatsApp Poll** (`Card updated - retry now`, `Remind me in 3 days`, `Talk to billing support`), and records `pollMessageId` + `Past Due` in Google Sheets.\n2. **Flow 2 - Interactive Poll Vote & Live Stripe Charge Retry:**\n   - **Supergreen Trigger** (`vote`) matches the customer's tap back to the exact invoice row via `pollMessageId`.\n   - **Option 0 (`Card updated - retry now`):** Calls Stripe `POST /v1/invoices/{id}/pay` immediately (`continueRegularOutput` on card decline). Marks `Recovered` and confirms on WhatsApp if paid, or sends the exact decline notice + portal URL if the card still fails.\n   - **Option 1 (`Remind me in 3 days`):** Sets `status = Snoozed` and `nextRetryAt = +72h` in Google Sheets and confirms the grace period on WhatsApp.\n   - **Option 2 (`Talk to billing support`):** Marks `Escalated`, posts customer + Stripe invoice details to **Slack**, and confirms human follow-up on WhatsApp.\n3. **Flow 3 - Daily Snooze Expiry & Retry Scheduler:**\n   - Runs daily at 09:00, finds expired `Snoozed` / `Past Due` invoices (`retryCount < 2`), sends a fresh recovery poll on WhatsApp, and updates `pollMessageId` + `retryCount`.\n4. **Flow 4 - Billing Failure Alerting:**\n   - **Error Trigger** posts failed node diagnostics to Slack so billing automations never fail silently.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install **n8n-nodes-supergreen** (`v0.1.5+`, verified on n8n Cloud & self-hosted) and connect **Stripe API**, **Supergreen API**, **Google Sheets OAuth2**, and **Slack OAuth2**.\n2. Create a Google Sheet tab named `Invoices` with columns: `invoiceId`, `invoiceNumber`, `customerId`, `phone`, `customerName`, `amount`, `status`, `pollMessageId`, `portalUrl`, `retryCount`, `nextRetryAt`, `updatedAt`.\n3. Fill in **Workflow Configuration** (`companyName`, `spreadsheetId`, `portalReturnUrl`, `slackBillingChannelId`)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b7070007-7777-4777-8777-000000000002",
      "name": "Flow 1 Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 2220,
        "height": 500,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Flow 1: Stripe Webhook Deduplication, Customer Lookup, PDF Receipt Delivery & Self-Serve Billing Portal Dunning\n\nResolves customer E.164 WhatsApp numbers from Stripe, delivers official PDF receipts on paid renewals, and launches a Stripe Billing Portal session + interactive WhatsApp Poll on failed renewals."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b7070007-7777-4777-8777-000000000003",
      "name": "Flow 2 Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        580
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 2220,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Flow 2: Real-Time WhatsApp Poll Vote Handler & Live Stripe Charge Retry (`POST /v1/invoices/{id}/pay`)\n\nMatches poll votes by `pollMessageId`, immediately attempts to collect payment in Stripe when a customer updates their card, schedules 72-hour grace snoozes, or escalates to Finance in Slack."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b7070007-7777-4777-8777-000000000004",
      "name": "Flow 3 & 4 Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        1180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 2220,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Flows 3 & 4: Daily Expired-Snooze Follow-Up Scheduler & Error Alerting\n\nRe-prompts overdue snoozed invoices up to 2 times with fresh WhatsApp polls and alerts Slack immediately if any billing workflow node errors."
      }
    },
